OL,3,ANearly 90,000 told to evacuate as
OL,4,Awildfire approaches Reno, Nevada
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people have been
OL,7,Ftold to evacuate from an area close to
OL,8,FReno, Nevada, as a large wildfire
OL,9,Freached the outskirts of the city.
OL,11,FAround 42,000 people have been ordered
OL,12,Fto leave their homes immediately, with
OL,13,Fa further 45,000 people urged to get
OL,14,Fready to leave.
OL,16,FThe fire, which was first reported on
OL,17,FSaturday morning, had so far injured
OL,18,Fsix people, officials said. Windy and
OL,19,Funpredictable weather conditions have
OL,20,Fcontributed to its spread.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
